-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan:p005","quote":"第十二皇女","kind":"person_reference","mention_id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan:p005:r0200"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"宋書卷八十的孝武皇室。同生的繫母另以子鸞傳和卷首皇子母序兩層證據記錄。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"hx8_st4_jdd","source_assertion_id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_siblings","sibling_assertion_ids":["a-nanshi011-yinshuyi-s-sister"],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-nanshi011-yinshuyi-s-father-子鸞"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-080","source_id":"s-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan-ws2261200","chapter_id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan:p005","quote":"帝素疾子鸞有寵，既誅羣公，乃遣使賜死，時年十歲。子鸞臨死，謂左右曰：「願身不復生王家。」同生弟妹並死，仍葬京口。太宗即位，詔曰：「夫紓寃申痛，雖往必追，緣情惻愛，感事彌遠。故使持節、都督南徐州諸軍事、撫軍將軍、南徐州刺史新安王子鸞，夙表成器，蚤延殊寵，方樹美業，克光蕃維。而凶心肆忌，奄羅橫禍，興言永傷，有兼常懷，宜旍夭秀，以雪沈魂。可贈使持節、侍中、都督南徐兗二州諸軍事、司徒、南徐州刺史，王如故。第十二皇女、第二十二皇子子師，俱嬰謬酷，有增酸悼，皇女可贈縣公主，子師復先封為南海王，並加徽諡。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan:p005:m0024","object_person_reference_id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan:p005:r0047","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan:p005","surface":"同生弟妹並死","start":44,"end":50},"source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi011-yinshuyi-s-sister","source_term":"同生弟妹並死"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-080","source_id":"s-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan-ws2261200","chapter_id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan:p001","quote":"始平孝敬王子鸞字孝羽，孝武帝第八子也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan:p001:m0005","object_person_reference_id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan:p001:r0011","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan:p001","surface":"孝武帝第八子","start":11,"end":17},"source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi011-yinshuyi-s-father-子鸞","source_term":"孝武帝第八子"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"子鸞的同生妹，第十二皇女；子鸞本傳直言其為